=== PHASE P18 PARITY AUDIT (bmp.c) ===
Source: Source/render/decoders/bmp.lua (BMPDecoder) — ported faithfully.

Scope:
- Reject len<54; "BM" signature.                                        [G.short_input / G.bad_signature]
- Fields u32le/i32le/u16le at Lua pos 11/15/19/23/29/31 (C offsets 10..30);
  missing bytes -> 0 (first+last byte presence guard == Lua `not b1 or not b4`).
- QUIRK preserved: compression is READ but NEVER CHECKED (MASTER_TODO said
  "compression checks" but the source ignores it) — port reads & discards.
- width<=0 or rawHeight==0 reject; top-down via negative height; height=abs.
- Scale: only when width>360 or height>200; scale=max(w/360,h/200) FLOAT;
  targetW/H=max(1,floor(dim/scale)) double math identical to Lua.        [D.wide 400x100 -> 360x90]
- Palette (bpp<=8): built to FULL 1<<bpp entries from palOffset=15+headerSize
  (1-based); BGR triplets -> rgbToGray; entries beyond file -> 0.        [D.b8 idx200 -> 0 quirk]
- rowBytes=floor((bpp*width+31)/32)*4 (DWORD pad).
- getPixelGray parity: nearest-neighbor floor(out*scale) clamped to dims;
  bottom-up flip bmpY=height-1-srcY; rowStart=pixelOffset+bmpY*rowBytes.
- Paths: 24bpp stride3 / 32bpp stride4 (alpha ignored), OOB falls through
  to 255; 8bpp idx `or 0` then palette[idx] or 0; 4bpp high/low nibble by
  srcX parity; 1bpp MSB-first bitIdx=7-(srcX%8), fallback (idx==1?255:0);
  other bpp (e.g.16) -> 255.
- Returns Dither.toImage(getPixelGray,targetW,targetH); C wrapper reuses
  P15 dither_to_image over a byte grid.

Fixtures (tools/gen_bmp_fixtures.py -> selftest_bmp_fixtures.h):
b24 gradient / b32 top-down solid / b8 short palette / b4 nibbles /
b1 MSB checker / wide forced-scale / bmp_bench 600x400 + analytic probes.

Test-side bugs found during bring-up (decoder faithful both times):
1) Fixture header generator wrapped hex lines mid-token -> C syntax errors;
   fixed to wrap on whole 0xNN tokens.
2) fx_bench packed the red channel into the blue byte slot while probes
   assumed red (bench(299,199): got 161 want 135). Fixed packing to
   R<<16|G<<8|B; decoder was correct all along.
3) Name collision with PNG fixtures header (both defined fx_bench for
   main.c) -> renamed BMP bench fixture to fx_bmp_bench.

